Why Is Demand Increasing

Contamination Control: Semiconductor manufacturing requires highly effective filtration to prevent particles and impurities from affecting wafer processes.

Advanced Wafer Fabrication: Increasing process complexity and smaller geometries require tighter control of process chemicals and gases.

Chemical and Gas Purity: Advanced fabs depend on high-purity process inputs, increasing demand for specialized filtration systems.

